!Name: x-djb-oscillators
!C Buckingham's oscillator collection
!C This is based on 25 pages of hand-drawn oscillators that were
!C sent by David Buckingham to several other Life enthusiasts on
!C January 30, 1990.  Bob Mayans typed the patterns for Rich
!C Schroeppel's database in March 1990, making careful notes about
!C errors and possible corrections.  The drawings are hard to read
!C in places but Bob was able to decipher most of them, and I've
!C figured out a few more; only #129 and possible variants of
!C #97 and #108 still elude us.
!C
!C The drawings are numbered from 1 to 165 and are mostly in order,
!C but 64 is between 126 and 128, 127 is between 129 and 130, and
!C 140 is between 137 and 138.  Also, some numbers are attached to
!C more than one drawing; in such cases letters are added to the
!C numbers below to distinguish them.  I've numbered the pages from
!C 0 to 24; each numbered column in the collection corresponds to
!C one page.  The table below shows the page number, drawing number,
!C period, and name (if any) of each oscillator.
!C
!C Dean Hickerson (drhickerson@ucdavis.edu)  11/4/94
!C
!C page    number  p   name    comments
!C ----    ------  -   ----    --------
!C 0       1       3
!C         2       3   "diamond ring"
!C         3-12    3
!C
